theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 19
text = "For this Mini-Game you will be matching answers to questions and
vice versa. You will click an answer and match it to the correct 
question, ot click a question and match it to the right answer. If you
match the wrong two cards then they will remain on screen, but if you
click matching cards then they will dissappear. After all cards 
dissappear it will give you four new questions and answers to work 
through. This will repeat a couple times."

